    {
      "position": 11,
      "source_id": null,
      "text": "引越をしたばかりなので、旅行どころではなくうちの 整理に手一杯です。 \nBecause I just moved this isn't the time for a trip, I have my hands full with getting the house in order.\n\nわたしは仕事で しばしば出張する ので、あちこち旅行できていいとみんなに言われるが、いつも忙しくて見物する どころではない. \nBecause I often go on business trips, everyone tells me I can vacation in different places, however, I'm always so busy I can't even think of sightseeing.",
      "html": "引越をしたばかりなので、旅行どころではなくうちの 整理に手一杯です。 <br/>Because I just moved this isn't the time for a trip, I have my hands full with getting the house in order.<br/><br/>わたしは仕事で しばしば出張する ので、あちこち旅行できていいとみんなに言われるが、いつも忙しくて見物する どころではない. <br/>Because I often go on business trips, everyone tells me I can vacation in different places, however, I'm always so busy I can't even think of sightseeing.",
      "credits_raw": "slopethisway",
      "content_sha256": "c6f2cb0320bb5d250cd5c85c0527c48edbab00277b42c762ea91d4472e466c7e",
      "original_created_at": null,
      "original_updated_at": null
    },
    {
      "position": 12,
      "source_id": null,
      "text": "I think it's better to just translate it as \nout of the question'. It saves confusion, in my opinion",
